rough Agentic Source Code Review","url":"https://cloud.google.com/blog/topics/threat-intelligence/staying-ahead-of-adversarial-ai-through-agentic-source-code-review/","date":1787061600,"author":"Mandiant","guid":360,"unread":true,"content":"<div><div data-draftjs-conductor-fragment=\"{&quot;blocks&quot;:[{&quot;key&quot;:&quot;b178m&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Written by: Alex Tselevich, Michael Maturi&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;unstyled&quot;,&quot;depth&quot;:0,&quot;inlineStyleRanges&quot;:[],&quot;entityRanges&quot;:[],&quot;data&quot;:{}}],&quot;entityMap&quot;:{}}\">Written by: Alex Tselevich, Michael Maturi</div><div data-draftjs-conductor-fragment=\"{&quot;blocks&quot;:[{&quot;key&quot;:&quot;b178m&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Written by: Alex Tselevich, Michael Maturi&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;unstyled&quot;,&quot;depth&quot;:0,&quot;inlineStyleRanges&quot;:[],&quot;entityRanges&quot;:[],&quot;data&quot;:{}}],&quot;entityMap&quot;:{}}\"><p><a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/sa-contrib-2026-062\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/sa-core-2026-005\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"></a></p><h3></h3><p><a href=\"https://adk.dev/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"https://antigravity.google/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"></a></p></div></div><div><div><div><figure><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-cloudblog-publish/images/Figure_1_Sequential_vulnerability_discover.max-1000x1000.png\" alt=\"Sequential vulnerability discovery methodology\"><figcaption><p data-block-key=\"xziys\">Figure 1: Sequential vulnerability discovery methodology</p></figcaption></figure></div></div></div><div><div><div><figure><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-cloudblog-publish/images/Figure_2_Codebase_reconnaissance_workflow_.max-1000x1000.png\" alt=\"Codebase reconnaissance workflow diagram\"><figcaption><p data-block-key=\"39dgt\">Figure 2: Codebase reconnaissance workflow diagram</p></figcaption></figure></div></div></div><div><div><div><figure><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-cloudblog-publish/images/Figure_3a.max-1000x1000.png\" alt=\"Visual representation of a threat model for a sample codebase\"><figcaption><p data-block-key=\"41c3z\">Figure 3: Visual representation of a threat model for a sample codebase</p></figcaption></figure></div></div></div><div><div><div><figure><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-cloudblog-publish/images/Figure_4_Entry_point_discovery_workflow_di.max-1000x1000.png\" alt=\"Entry point discovery workflow diagram\"><figcaption><p data-block-key=\"41c3z\">Figure 4: Entry point discovery workflow diagram</p></figcaption></figure></div></div></div><div><div><div><figure><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-cloudblog-publish/images/Figure_5_Context_enrichment_workflow_diagr.max-1000x1000.png\" alt=\"Context enrichment workflow diagram\"><figcaption><p data-block-key=\"repmw\">Figure 5: Context enrichment workflow diagram</p></figcaption></figure></div></div></div><div><div><div><figure><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-cloudblog-publish/images/Figure_6_Hypothesis_generation_gating_diag.max-1000x1000.png\" alt=\"Hypothesis generation gating diagram\"><figcaption><p data-block-key=\"7ea9j\">Figure 6: Hypothesis generation gating diagram</p></figcaption></figure></div></div></div><div><ul></ul></div><div><div><div><figure><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-cloudblog-publish/images/Figure_7_Hypothesis_validation_workflow_di.max-1000x1000.png\" alt=\"Hypothesis validation workflow diagram\"><figcaption><p data-block-key=\"wje77\">Figure 7: Hypothesis validation workflow diagram</p></figcaption></figure></div></div></div><div><h3></h3></div><div><div><div><figure><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-cloudblog-publish/images/Figure_8_Human-in-the-loop_handover_diagra.max-1000x1000.png\" alt=\"Human-in-the-loop handover diagram\"><figcaption><p data-block-key=\"3mbyc\">Figure 8: Human-in-the-loop handover diagram</p></figcaption></figure></div></div></div><div><div><div><figure><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-cloudblog-publish/images/Figure_9_Agentic_rule_system_hierarchy.max-1000x1000.png\" alt=\"Agentic rule system hierarchy\"><figcaption><p data-block-key=\"q0685\">Figure 9: Agentic rule system hierarchy</p></figcaption></figure></div></div></div><div><p data-block-key=\"l6qnf\">Framework and language rules apply across the entire pipeline, equipping the agents with consultant insights into the specific technologies employed within the target codebase. These rules encompass critical details, such as common entry point definition patterns and unique attack surfaces, with additional contextual information essential for threat modeling.</p><p data-block-key=\"2vkgb\">In contrast, vulnerability rules apply exclusively during the final stages of the pipeline, prescribing precisely how to discover, validate, and risk-rate specific types of vulnerabilities. This structured system ensures the entire analysis pipeline is infused with Mandiant’s human expertise in a maintainable, highly modular way.</p></div><div><div><div><figure><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-cloudblog-publish/images/Methodology_rule_application_diagram.max-1000x1000.png\" alt=\"Methodology rule application diagram\"><figcaption><p data-block-key=\"1e399\">Figure 10: Methodology rule application diagram</p></figcaption></figure></div></div></div><div><ul></ul></div><div><div><div><figure><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-cloudblog-publish/images/Figure_11_Benchmarking_process_diagram.max-1000x1000.png\" alt=\"Benchmarking process diagram\"><figcaption><p data-block-key=\"7bqyx\">Figure 11: Benchmarking process diagram</p></figcaption></figure></div></div></div><div><p><a href=\"https://cloud.google.com/blog/topics/threat-intelligence/ai-assisted-vulnerability-management\"></a><a href=\"https://cloud.google.com/security/ai-threat-defense?e=48754805\"></a></p></div>","contentLength":1269,"flags":null,"enclosureUrl":"","enclosureMime":"","commentsUrl":null},{"title":"UNC6671 Rebrands: Multi-Brand Vishing Extortion Targets Financial Services and Enterprise Cloud Environments","url":"https://cloud.google.com/blog/topics/threat-intelligence/unc6671-targets-financial-services-and-enterprise-cloud-environments/","date":1786024800,"author":"Mandiant","guid":378,"unread":true,"content":"<div><p>Written by: </p></div><div><p><a href=\"https://cloud.google.com/blog/topics/threat-intelligence/blackfile-vishing-extortion-operation/\"></a></p><h3></h3></div><div><div><div><figure><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-cloudblog-publish/images/image5_j8OyMFx.max-1000x1000.png\" alt=\"Figure 1: UNC6671 Associated DLS Listings by Site\"><figcaption><p data-block-key=\"n0ggv\">Figure 1: UNC6671 Associated DLS Listings by Site</p></figcaption></figure></div></div></div><div><div><div><figure><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-cloudblog-publish/images/image7_AjGM9oz.max-1000x1000.png\" alt=\"Figure 2: Helix and Pink DLS\"><figcaption><p data-block-key=\"n0ggv\">Figure 2: Helix and Pink DLS</p></figcaption></figure></div></div></div><div><div><div><figure><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-cloudblog-publish/images/image2_fu0mgVu.max-1000x1000.png\" alt=\"Figure 3: Falcon DLS\"></figure></div></div></div><div><h3></h3></div><div><div><div><figure><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-cloudblog-publish/images/image4_Z4ooCAI.max-1000x1000.png\" alt=\"Figure 3: REDACT statement on alleged break from BlackFile\"><figcaption><p data-block-key=\"n0ggv\">Figure 3: REDACT statement on alleged break from BlackFile</p></figcaption></figure></div></div></div><div><h4></h4><ul></ul></div><div><div><div><figure><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-cloudblog-publish/images/Screenshot_2026-08-06_at_10.23.36AM.max-1000x1000.png\" alt=\"Figure 4 - fixed\"><figcaption><p data-bloc