 href=\"https://blog.virustotal.com/2026/02/from-automation-to-infection-how.html\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"https://www.koi.ai/blog/postmark-mcp-npm-malicious-backdoor-email-theft\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"https://www.reversinglabs.com/blog/claude-promptmink-malware-crypto\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"></a></p><h4></h4><p><a href=\"https://openssf.org/blog/2023/10/12/introducing-openssfs-malicious-packages-repository/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"></a></p></div><div><div><div><figure><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-cloudblog-publish/images/BattenDownYourPackages_2.max-1000x1000.png\" alt=\"Count of malicious open source packages\"><figcaption><p data-block-key=\"vn5dq\">Figure 2: Count of malicious open source packages reported 2022–2025 (source: <a href=\"https://ossf.github.io/malicious-packages/stats/\">OpenSSF</a>)</p></figcaption></figure></div></div></div><div><h3></h3><p><a href=\"https://www.fbi.gov/investigate/cyber/alerts/2025/north-korea-responsible-for-1-5-billion-bybit-hack\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"https://x.com/safe/status/1897663514975649938?s=20\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"https://slowmist.medium.com/bybits-1-5-billion-theft-unveiled-safe-wallet-front-end-code-tampered-84b78f0fa9c2\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"https://www.sygnia.co/blog/sygnia-investigation-bybit-hack/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://notepad-plus-plus.org/news/hijacked-incident-info-update/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"https://securelist.com/tr/daemon-tools-backdoor/119654/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.securityweek.com/100-car-dealerships-hit-by-supply-chain-attack/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"https://sansec.io/research/license-backdoor\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"></a></p><h3></h3><h4></h4><ul><li aria-level=\"1\"><p role=\"presentation\"><strong>Cataloging Assets and Dependencies: </strong></p></li><li aria-level=\"1\"><p role=\"presentation\"><strong>Software Bill of Materials (SBOM)</strong></p></li><li aria-level=\"1\"><p role=\"presentation\"><strong>Action Bill of Materials (ABOM):</strong></p></li><li aria-level=\"1\"><p role=\"presentation\"><strong>Software Development Lifecycle (SDLC) Threat Modeling and Attack Chain Mapping (Wiz SITF):</strong><a href=\"https://github.com/wiz-sec-public/SITF\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"></a></p></li><li aria-level=\"1\"><p role=\"presentation\"><strong>Standardized Configuration &amp; Change Control:</strong></p></li><li aria-level=\"1\"><p role=\"presentation\"><strong>Staff Security Education:</strong></p></li></ul><h4></h4><ul><li aria-level=\"1\"><p role=\"presentation\"><strong>Cybersecurity Provisions in Contracts:</strong></p></li><li aria-level=\"1\"><p role=\"presentation\"><strong>Hardware Provenance and Verification:</strong></p></li></ul><h4></h4><h5></h5><ul><li aria-level=\"1\"><p role=\"presentation\"><strong>Automated System and Workload Identities</strong></p></li><li aria-level=\"1\"><p role=\"presentation\"><strong>Developer and User Identity Controls (command-line interface (CLI) and Repository Access): </strong></p></li><ul><li aria-level=\"2\"><p role=\"presentation\"><strong>Enforce Strict Token Expiration:</strong></p></li><li aria-level=\"2\"><p role=\"presentation\"><strong>Consider Restricting Personal Access Tokens to Neutralize Git-over-HTTPS &amp; Mandate FIDO2 Secure Shell (SSH): </strong></p></li></ul><li aria-level=\"1\"><p role=\"presentation\"><strong>Isolated CI/CD Execution:</strong></p></li><li aria-level=\"1\"><p role=\"presentation\"><strong>Workflow Trigger Governance (pull_request_target): </strong></p></li></ul><h4></h4><ul><li aria-level=\"1\"><p role=\"presentation\"><strong>Zero Trust and Least Privilege:</strong></p></li><li aria-level=\"1\"><p role=\"presentation\"><strong>Network Micro-Segmentation:</strong></p></li></ul><h4></h4><ul><li aria-level=\"1\"><p role=\"presentation\"><strong>Pipeline and Sandbox Isolation:</strong></p></li><li aria-level=\"1\"><p role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"https://cloud.google.com/security/products/assured-open-source-software\"></a></p></li></ul><ul><li aria-level=\"1\"><p role=\"presentation\"><strong>Lifecycle Script Sandboxing (ignore-scripts)</strong></p></li><li aria-level=\"1\"><p role=\"presentation\"><strong>Software Composition Analysis (SCA) with Google OSV-Scanner:</strong><a href=\"https://github.com/google/osv.dev\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"></a></p></li><ul><li aria-level=\"2\"><p role=\"presentation\"><strong>High-Fidelity Vulnerability Detection</strong></p></li></ul><li aria-level=\"1\"><p role=\"presentation\"><strong>Authoritative &amp; Collaborative Threat Intel:</strong></p></li><li aria-level=\"1\"><p role=\"presentation\"><strong>Hardware-Backed Key Protection:</strong></p></li><li aria-level=\"1\"><p role=\"presentation\"><strong>Hardened Distribution Points:</strong></p></li><li aria-level=\"1\"><p role=\"presentation\"><strong>Audit NPM Package Maintainer Accounts for Stale or Expired Recovery Email Domains: </strong></p></li><ul></ul></ul><h4><strong>Integration with Native Ecosystem Guardrails&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></h4><ul></ul><ul><li aria-level=\"1\"><p role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"https://github.blog/security/supply-chain-security/the-case-for-a-cooldown-why-dependabot-now-waits-before-issuing-version-updates/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Dependabot Native Cooldowns (July 2026)</strong></a></p></li><li aria-level=\"1\"><p role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"https://blog.pypi.org/posts/2026-07-22-releases-now-reject-new-files-after-14-days/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>PyPI Server-Side Immutability (July 2026)]</strong></a></p></li><li aria-level=\"1\"><p role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/2026-06-09-upcoming-breaking-changes-for-npm-v12/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>npm v12 Install-Time Defaults (July 2026)</strong></a></p></li></ul><p><a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/?label=supply-chain-security\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"></a></p><h4></h4><h5><em></em></h5><ul><li aria-level=\"1\"><p role=\"presentation\"><strong>Automate SBOM Management:</strong></p></li><li aria-level=\"1\"><p role=\"presentation\"><strong>Security Analysis Integration:</strong></p></li><li aria-level=\"1\"><p role=\"presentation\"><strong>Verification of Cryptographic Integrity:</strong></p></li><li aria-level=\"1\"><p role=\"presentation\"><strong>Implement autonomous security verification</strong></p></li></ul><h5><em></em></h5><ul><li aria-level=\"1\"><p role=\"presentation\"><strong>Egress and Proxy Analysis:</strong></p></li><li aria-level=\"1\"><p role=\"presentation\"><strong>Comprehensive Endpoint Security:</strong></p></li><li aria-level=\"1\"><p role=\"presentation\"><strong>Log Aggregation and Alerting:</strong></p></li><ul></ul></ul><h5><em></em></h5><ul><li aria-level=\"1\"><p role=\"presentation\"><strong>Specific Supply Chain Playbooks:</strong></p><ul><li aria-level=\"2\"><p role=\"presentation\"><strong>Upstream Package Takeover:</strong></p></li><li aria-level=\"2\"><p role=\"presentation\"><strong>Dependency Confusion Exploits</strong></p></li><li aria-level=\"2\"><p role=\"presentation\"><strong>Automated Pipeline Harvesting:</strong></p></li><li role=\"presentation\"><strong>Developer Workstation &amp; IDE Compromise: </strong></li></ul></li><li aria-level=\"1\"><p role=\"presentation\"><strong>Operational Re-evaluation:</strong></p></li></ul></div>","contentLength":1853,"flags":null,"enclosureUrl":"","enclosureMime":"","commentsUrl":null},{"title":"Updated Cyber Threat Actor Naming System","url":"https://cloud.google.com/blog/topics/threat-intelligence/updated-cyber-threat-actor-naming-system/","date":1784901600,"author":"Goog